abstract: >-
  A deterministic, dependency-free implementation of Chan-theory price structure
  (inclusion merging, fractals, strokes, segments, pivots, divergence,
  first/second/third class buy-sell points) with a multi-market data layer and a
  teaching-oriented visualization workstation.
